---
layout: layouts/base.njk
current: pricing
title: Free 30-day trial
permalink: /trial/
description: "Try Program Partner free for 30 days, with no card. Tell us about your program and we'll reply within one business day to set it up with you."
---
{#- A trial is requested, not self-serve: the form lands in Console → Prospects like any Let's chat message, with
    "Free 30-day trial" ticked, and the owner sets the trial program up by hand (owner decision, 24 November 2026). -#}
{%- set t = copy["trial"] -%}
{%- set chatForm = { heading: t.form.heading, intro: t.form.intro, submit: t.form.submit, topic: "trial", kind: "trial" } -%}
<div style="padding:clamp(48px,7vw,96px) 0 var(--section-y)">
<div class="wrap" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(40px,6vw,80px);align-items:flex-start">
<div class="stack" style="flex:1 1 320px;max-width:440px;gap:20px">
<p class="eyebrow">{{ t.hero.eyebrow }}</p>
<h1 style="font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,60px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-wrap:balance">{{ t.hero.heading }}</h1>
<p class="body-lg muted">{{ t.hero.subhead }}</p>
<div class="stack" style="gap:14px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
<h2 style="font-size:24px;line-height:1.25">{{ t.how.heading }}</h2>
<ol class="trial-steps">
{%- for it in t.how.items %}<li>{{ it }}</li>{% endfor %}
</ol>
{%- if pricing.founding and t.how.founding_note %}<p class="callout" style="font-size:15px;padding:12px 16px">{{ t.how.founding_note }}</p>{% endif %}
</div>
<p class="muted" style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6">{{ t.aside.before }} <a href="/demo/">{{ t.aside.link }}</a>. {{ t.aside.after }} <a href="/pricing/">{{ t.aside.pricing_link }}</a>.</p>
</div>
{% include "partials/chat-form.njk" %}
</div>
</div>
